Z||000005||Pontiaddict||07-06-2001||05:36 PM||||Notchback GT's have the ribbed molding like 84-86 coupes.<BR>Fastback Gt's have rounded molding like 87-88 coupes.<BR>Gt aero fascias all have the ground effects.<P>Tiggers car has the GT fascias on it but not the ground effects on the sides and it still looks pretty good.<BR>||||reg||1
